OL,3,GNEWSAWorcester Warriors mementos fund
OL,4,Adementia cafes
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom long-forgotten replica shirts to
OL,7,Fscarves from seasons gone by ` a room
OL,8,Ffull of Worcester Warriors memorabilia
OL,9,Fis helping raise money for local people
OL,10,Fwith dementia.
OL,12,FThe Worcester Warriors Foundation has
OL,13,Fopened a new kit room at its Severn
OL,14,FStreet base in Worcester, offering
OL,15,Fsupporters the chance to buy donated
OL,16,Fclothing and merchandise spanning more
OL,17,Fthan a decade of the club's history.
OL,19,FPacked with training gear, jackets,
OL,20,Fhats and boots, fundraising manager
OL,21,FDaniel Hart described it as "a bit of a
OL,22,Fmuseum" of the club's recent history.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
